#: fileshare.cpp:39
msgid "File Sharing"
msgstr "Dateien delen"

#: fileshare.cpp:43
msgid "Do &not allow users to share files"
msgstr "Verlööv den Brukern &nich, Datein to delen."

#: fileshare.cpp:44
msgid "&Allow users to share files from their HOME folder"
msgstr "&Verlööv den Brukern Datein to delen, de in jümehr HOME-Ordner sünn."

#: fileshare.cpp:55
msgid ""
"SMB and NFS servers are not installed on this machine, to enable this module "
"the servers must be installed."
msgstr ""
"SMB- un NFS-Server sünn op düt Rekner nich installeert. Wenn Du düt "
"Moduul bruuken wullst, dann mööt düsse Servers installeert ween."

#: fileshare.cpp:140
msgid ""
"<h1>File Sharing</h1>"
"<p>"
"This module can be used to enable file sharing over the network using the "
"\"Network File System\" (NFS) or SMB in Konqueror. The latter enables you to "
"share your files with Windows(TM) computers on your network.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Datein delen</h1>"
"<p>Mit düt Moduul kannst du verlöven, Datein över dat Netwark to delen. "
"Dat löppt dann över dat \"Network File System (NFS\" (Netwark "
"Dateisysteem) oder över SMB in Konqueror. Mit Konqueror kannst du Datein "
"mit Windows(TM)-Reeknern in dien Netwark delen.</p>"
